Use cXssMarkdownSanitizer.pkg

// Markdown source profile. Raw HTML and non-HTTP(S) links are removed before
// Markdown is stored or handed to a browser parser. Sanitize remains available
// for callers that need to sanitize generated HTML as a separate step.
Global_Variable Handle ghoMarkdownSanitizer

Object oXssSanitizerMarkdown is a cXssMarkdownSanitizer
    Move Self to ghoMarkdownSanitizer
End_Object
